# Private source kind after the reference cutover

A planner decision is needed before this slice changes. Section 8 requires a
handler to obtain sender kind from verified genesis. Existing offline Replay
can instead judge retained private Register and Membership entries without
reading or exporting their genesis. The new wire format removes the kind
that those retained entries currently carry.

This question concerns only that existing exact-anchor private-copy path.
It does not open implementation, export more private bytes, add a resolver,
or change live authority. All facts below come from source at main
`df41e59964f09ce1d723ce870f5e4e5c6d8d4641`. No application or validation ran.

